<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>Your information | RIPL Money Starting Point</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/money-at-work/style.css"/></head><body><main class="wrap" style="max-width:850px;padding-top:50px;padding-bottom:60px"><a href="/">← Back to your money starting point</a><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:35px">RIPL WEALTH</p><h1>Your information.<br/>Your choice.</h1><p>You can take the review, watch videos, and save your starting point without giving us your name or email.</p><h2>The money review</h2><p>Your answers and result are held in this page’s memory. Reloading or closing the page clears them. Saving your starting point downloads a text file to your device; it does not send it to RIPL. You can choose to include your completed review when submitting an inquiry.</p><h2>Contacting Adam</h2><p>The inquiry form sends your name, email, question, campaign labels, and page address to Adam at RIPL Wealth through FormSubmit. If you select “Include my completed money review,” it also sends your answers, stage, tendency, and starting point. Submitting requests a response to your inquiry. It does not subscribe you to a newsletter or request text messages.</p><p>Please do not include account numbers, passwords, Social Security numbers, or private financial documents.</p><h2>Scheduling</h2><p>Calendly loads when you choose to open available times. It handles the booking information you enter and your appointment confirmation. Campaign labels can travel with the calendar link. Quiz answers are not automatically transmitted to Calendly or attached to a booking. You may send them separately to Adam using the inquiry form.</p><h2>Videos and fonts</h2><p>Video thumbnail images may load from YouTube as you browse the page. Opening a recorded video loads a YouTube privacy-enhanced player. Playback is subject to YouTube’s privacy practices. Google Fonts supplies the page’s typography. FormSubmit and Calendly also operate under their own privacy practices.</p><h2>Campaign labels and interaction events</h2><p>UTM labels identify an ad source or campaign. They stay in browser session storage for the current tab session and can be included in an inquiry or calendar link. This version also creates in-page interaction events, such as review completion or a Calendly booking confirmation, for possible measurement. No analytics collector or advertising pixel is installed in this version, and these events contain no name, email, question text, quiz answers, or financial stage. A separate analytics integration would require updated disclosures as appropriate.</p><h2>Questions about your information</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:adam@riplwealth.com">adam@riplwealth.com</a> about access, correction, or record retention. See also <a href="https://riplwealth.com/privacy/">RIPL’s general website privacy information</a>.</p></main></body></html>
